        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you.\r\n\r\n4 Bedroom, 4 Bathroom, Mid Terrace Family Home \r\nSplit over 3 levels / Parking to the front of the property \r\nParking to front of Bulding\r\nBeautifully presented and maintained. \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 11 Rowan Walk to the Dublin 22 property market. \r\nThis wonderful four-bedroom, four-bathroom, mid-terrace family home is ideally located in the highly sought-after Kilcarbery Grange development in Dublin 22. Set back from the road, the property enjoys excellent curb appeal and gives an immediate impression of a well-maintained and welcoming family home. The current owners have lovingly maintained and thoughtfully upgraded the property throughout, creating a stylish, comfortable and highly practical home that will appeal to families and discerning purchasers alike.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a bright and inviting hallway with beautiful herringbone flooring running throughout the downstairs accommodation. To the left of the entrance is the generous front family/living room, which is filled with natural light through the large front window. This attractive reception room is further enhanced by bespoke built-in cabinetry, providing excellent storage while adding to the room's overall style and character. Continuing through the property, there is a convenient downstairs WC before entering the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and dining space is a fantastic feature of the home, offering an abundance of base and eye-level storage together with generous worktop space. Bright and spacious, this room provides the perfect setting for family dining, entertaining friends or simply enjoying everyday family life. A separate laundry room provides additional practicality and storage. From the dining area, double doors open directly onto the large, low-maintenance rear garden. The current owners have thoughtfully upgraded the garden with raised beds and artificial grass, creating an attractive outdoor space ideal for children, outdoor dining and entertaining during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nMoving upstairs to the first floor, there are three large and bright double bedrooms. The impressive master bedroom benefits from a stylish ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe, offering excellent storage and a comfortable private retreat. The two additional bedrooms are also generous in size and both benefit from built-in wardrobes. A large family bathroom completes the accommodation on this floor and is finished with quality sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation continues to the second floor, where you will find the fourth bedroom. This is an exceptionally versatile space which could be used in a number of ways depending on the requirements of the new owners. It would make an ideal fourth bedroom, home office, children's playroom, gym, guest room or even a second living room. There is also an additional long walk-in wardrobe on this floor, which has been bespoke designed by the current owners and provides an impressive amount of additional storage space.\r\n\r\nThe owners have clearly taken great pride in their home and have lovingly maintained and enhanced it over the years. The property combines generous and versatile accommodation with excellent storage, bright living spaces and a superb low-maintenance rear garden, making it a standout home within this popular development.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Kilcarbery Grange is a popular residential development situated close to Corkagh Park, one of Dublin's most extensive recreational amenities. The park offers beautiful open green spaces, walking and cycling routes, playgrounds, sporting facilities, gardens and plenty of opportunities for outdoor family activities. The property is also conveniently located for Clondalkin village, where residents can enjoy a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and local services. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is also within easy reach, providing an extensive range of retail, dining and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, with a number of bus routes operating locally and providing convenient connections throughout Dublin. The location also offers excellent access to the N7 and M50 motorway network, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas straightforward. Clondalkin/Fonthill railway station is also within easy reach and provides rail connections towards Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for, with a number of primary and secondary schools located within the surrounding area, including St Ronan's National School, Sruleen National School, Scoil Nano Nagle, Talbot Senior National School and Gaelscoil Chluain Dolcáin, with further educational options available throughout Clondalkin and the wider Dublin 22 area.\r\n\r\nOverall, 11 Rowan Walk represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained and thoughtfully upgraded four-bedroom family home in a highly desirable Dublin 22 location. With its generous three-storey accommodation, stylish interiors, excellent storage, versatile fourth bedroom, master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, superb open-plan kitchen and dining area and attractive low-maintenance rear garden, this impressive property offers everything required for modern family living. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
